OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear skies
OL,6,Fand light winds to start with during
OL,7,Fthe evening. Mist and fog forming in
OL,8,Feastern areas during the early hours
OL,9,Fof the morning. Staying clear and dry
OL,10,Fin the west and north. Chillier than
OL,11,Fof late.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FFog and low cloud generally
OL,14,Fclearing, but perhaps lingering all
OL,15,Fday in places, but another dry day
OL,16,Fwith sunny spells. Mild in the
OL,17,Fsunshine but chilly where it stays
OL,18,Ffoggy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
