OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FIsolated
OL,6,Ffog and mist to start Sunday, but a
OL,7,Fcloudier day follows with patchy light
OL,8,Frain. Dry with sunny spells through
OL,9,FMonday and Tuesday. Light winds
OL,10,Fthroughout.
